{"id": "sfusd-clean-energy-contract-and-late-reports", "title": "SFUSD bypassed bidding on an energy contract and filed project reports late", "seconds": 44.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "e89d7871248fe3c0", "words": 133, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two schools received energy upgrades. Who checked the contracts and the results?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.34, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["School", "energy", "upgrades"], "sub": "A contract without documented competition"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.59, 0.93, 1.28, 2.12, 2.3, 2.52, 2.63, 3.09, 3.19, 3.28]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "State auditors flagged a $32,074 contract awarded without competition.", "t0": 4.34, "t1": 9.44, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "State Controller audit", "rows": [["Energy services contract", "$32,074"], ["Vendor", "Strategic Energy Innovations"]]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.39, 0.87, 1.18, 1.27, 1.83, 2.3, 2.86, 3.18, 3.7, 4.1, 4.43]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two other contracts left out the projected energy savings.", "t0": 9.56, "t1": 12.3, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "controller", "kicker": "A contract without documented competition", "text": "Projected energy savings", "mark": "Projected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.42, 0.93, 1.13, 1.27, 1.39, 1.86, 2.19]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Controller recommended recovery.", "t0": 12.52, "t1": 14.13, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Recovery recommendation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.59, 1.08]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The oversight board listed the amount in March 2022.", "t0": 14.25, "t1": 17.21, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "The recovery recommendation", "text": "March 2022", "mark": "March"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.62, 0.94, 1.27, 1.37, 1.71, 1.83, 2.1, 2.37]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its table gave no collection status for San Francisco.", "t0": 17.33, "t1": 19.9, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Collection status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.52, 0.71, 0.86, 1.29, 1.64, 1.78, 1.96]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A separate audit identified 13 late project reports.", "t0": 20.02, "t1": 22.79, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "13 late reports", "label": "Thirteen delayed reports"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.43, 0.7, 1.25, 1.72, 1.89, 2.22]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Twelve arrived on the same day in June 2022.", "t0": 22.91, "t1": 25.42, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "June 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.72, 0.83, 1.06, 1.27, 1.38, 1.67, 1.94]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "At Lau Elementary, 1,728 days passed before the report was submitted.", "t0": 25.54, "t1": 30.52, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Shortest interval", "481 days"], ["Lau Elementary", "1,728 days"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.5, 1.44, 1.67, 2.11, 2.39, 2.66, 3.13, 3.44, 3.76, 4.04, 4.14, 4.42, 4.53]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state extended its statewide deadline during the pandemic.", "t0": 30.64, "t1": 33.43, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Statewide deadline"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.36, 0.77, 0.93, 1.46, 1.9, 2.13, 2.23]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next audit said annual testing had ended.", "t0": 33.65, "t1": 35.63, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "follow", "kicker": "What the follow-up establishes", "text": "Annual testing", "mark": "Annual"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.33, 0.62, 0.84, 1.18, 1.53, 1.64]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The 2026 proposal names other recipients in San Francisco.", "t0": 35.75, "t1": 39.25, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Other recipients"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.41, 0.9, 1.38, 1.69, 2.03, 2.59, 2.69, 2.87]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The district’s final repayment record is still needed.", "t0": 39.37, "t1": 41.58, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final determination"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.51, 0.8, 1.22, 1.52, 1.6, 1.84]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 41.7, "t1": 43.84, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A contract without documented competition", "b": "The recovery recommendation", "o": "What the follow-up establishes"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}